's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"c7440a491128730ddddafbf65086e0a8","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"d7e32bb8a740322ca7a8f3d322b6efad","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"cdd84754a050e9ab970eddff6d8d8a42","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ffd30b1402619e2399ca61ddd23a5db8","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"5420b560aa4c206617ff962434aa5559","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"dffc841d3b80522eee4b9c2852dd8ec2","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"id":"af8ad81541d4d735b5af127d9f16c907","originalFileName":"f7181cfb-2c59-4551-87e6-161fe830c417-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"log","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":68},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"5fcc38f2